ibus-myangler (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Linux release.
  * IBus engine with full feature parity against the macOS IMK build:
    keystroke routing, candidate panel, Tab cycling, Compose/Roman
    toggle, punctuation auto-mapping, mixed-script input.
  * GTK4 + libadwaita Preferences app (Setup, Preferences, History,
    Convert, Diagnostics tabs); follows system theme/dark/accent.
  * GSettings schema com.myangler.inputmethod.burmese mirrors the
    macOS UserDefaults keys 1:1.
  * Settings change live (no daemon restart) including
    cluster-aliases-enabled, which rebuilds the parser on flip.

 -- rtrydev <r.kulka44@gmail.com>  Fri, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
